%[text] %[text:anchor:H_76814424] ## Problem 3: 
%[text] Based on the observations you just made, write down two hypotheses about how bill length or bill depth differs (or doesn't!) between species. You can come up with any hypotheses you want, as long as you can test them! 
%[text] ![](text:image:3391) For hypothesis 1, jot down the null and alternate hypotheses. 
%[text] Use `ttest2()` to test your hypothesis: 

%[text] ![](text:image:1ce5) Write a sentence or two about what the test decision (h) and p-value (p) mean. Was your hypothesis proven or disproven? 
